"Every level is a new board: bigger, smaller or oddly shaped, with holes that gems fall past and ice already in place. Collect the crystals within the moves to clear it, and unused moves score a bonus. Run out of moves and you try the level again. Your progress is saved." = "每一关都是新棋盘：更大、更小或形状特别，有宝石会穿过的空洞，开局就带着冰块。在步数内收集水晶即可过关，剩余步数会带来奖励。步数用完就重玩本关。进度会自动保存。";
"Swipe a gem towards its neighbour, or tap one gem and then the other. Bombs, crosses and lightning work as in the classic game. Above the board you see the level, the moves left and the crystals collected." = "将宝石滑向相邻宝石，或先点一颗再点另一颗。炸弹、十字和闪电的效果与经典模式相同。棋盘上方显示关卡、剩余步数和已收集的水晶。";
"Collect the crystals before the timer runs out: a crystal is collected when its gem is cleared. Reach the goal to move on to the next level with a fresh minute and a time bonus. Each level needs more crystals and brings more ice. Play solo for a record, or race friends: everyone gets the same boards, and the best score once every clock has run out takes first place." = "在计时结束前收集水晶：宝石被消除时即可收集其水晶。达成目标后进入下一关，获得新的一分钟和时间奖励。每一关需要更多水晶，冰块也更多。可以独自挑战纪录，也可以和好友竞速：大家的棋盘相同，所有人的时间都用完后，得分最高者获得第一名。";
"Out of moves" = "步数用完";
"Moves bonus +%d" = "步数奖励 +%d";
"Moves left: %d" = "剩余步数：%d";
"Play solo" = "挑战纪录";
"Place %d" = "第 %d 名";
"Your score: %d" = "你的得分：%d";
"%@ won with %d" = "%@ 以 %d 分获胜";
"Waiting for the others to finish…" = "等待其他玩家完成…";
"Classic" = "经典";
"Blitz" = "闪电战";
"Gems" = "宝石消消乐";
"Gems Blitz" = "宝石闪电战";
"Swap gems, chain cascades, set off bombs" = "交换宝石，连锁消除，引爆炸弹";
"Collect crystals before the time runs out" = "在时间用完前收集水晶";
"Swap two neighbouring gems to line up three or more of a colour. Four in a line leaves a bomb, an L or T shape leaves a cross, five in a line leaves lightning. Gems that fall into new lines score a growing combo. Frozen gems can't be moved: match through them twice, or blast them. The game ends when no move is left, and every power still on the board goes off for a last bonus." = "交换相邻的两颗宝石，让三颗或更多同色宝石连成一线。四连生成炸弹，L 形或 T 形生成十字，五连生成闪电。自动落入新连线的宝石会带来递增的连击。冰冻宝石无法移动：经它连线两次或将其炸开即可。没有可走的步时游戏结束，场上剩余的道具都会引爆，带来最后的加分。";
"Swipe a gem towards its neighbour, or tap one gem and then the other. Swap two powers together for a bigger blast. Lightning clears every gem of the colour you swap it with. Tap Hint if you're stuck." = "将宝石滑向相邻宝石，或先点一颗再点另一颗。把两个道具交换可引发更大的爆炸。闪电会清除与其交换的颜色的所有宝石。卡住时点“提示”。";
"Swipe a gem towards its neighbour, or tap one gem and then the other. Bombs, crosses and lightning work as in Gems. If no move is left the board is shuffled. The clock waits while gems are falling." = "将宝石滑向相邻宝石，或先点一颗再点另一颗。炸弹、十字和闪电的效果与宝石消消乐相同。没有可走的步时棋盘会重新洗牌。宝石下落时计时暂停。";
"Swipe a gem to swap it with a neighbour." = "滑动宝石即可与相邻宝石交换。";
"No moves — shuffling" = "无步可走——正在洗牌";
"Last chord!" = "最后的和弦！";
"Time bonus +%d" = "时间奖励 +%d";
"Crystals: %d of %d" = "水晶：%d / %d";

/* Minesweeper */
"%d×%d, %d mines" = "%d×%d，%d 颗雷";
"Some digits are wrong" = "有些数字不对";
"%d×%d, %d clues" = "%d×%d，%d 个提示";
"Maze Paint" = "迷宫涂色";
"Swipe to paint every square" = "滑动涂满每一格";
"Swipe to roll the ball until it hits a wall. Keep your finger down and swipe again to turn. Paint every square." = "滑动让小球一直滚到墙边。手指不离开屏幕再次滑动即可转向。涂满每一格。";
"Crossword" = "填字游戏";
"Fill the grid from the clues" = "根据提示填满格子";
"Asyk" = "羊拐骨游戏";
"Knock the asyks out of the ring" = "把羊拐骨击出圈外";
"Fill the grid with words that match the clues. Correct words turn green and lock in place." = "用符合提示的单词填满格子。正确的单词会变绿并锁定。";
"Tap a cell to choose a word; tap it again to switch between across and down. Type with the keyboard below. Hints reveal one letter." = "点击格子选择单词，再点一次切换横向与纵向。用下方键盘输入。提示会揭示一个字母。";
"Asyk ату is a traditional Kazakh game. Knock asyks out of the ring with your сақа to win them. Hit one and you shoot again; miss and the computer takes its turn. Whoever wins more asyks wins." = "阿斯克是哈萨克族传统游戏。用你的萨卡把羊拐骨击出圈外即可赢得它们。击中就再投一次，没中就轮到电脑。赢得羊拐骨更多的一方获胜。";
"Drag back from your сақа like a slingshot and release to throw. Before throwing, drag along the bottom line to move the сақа." = "像弹弓一样把萨卡往后拉再松手投出。投之前可沿底线拖动调整位置。";
"Shoot again!" = "再投一次！";
"You %d : %d Computer" = "你 %d : %d 电脑";
"Your turn" = "轮到你";
"Computer's turn" = "轮到电脑";
"Pull your сақа back like a slingshot and release. Knock asyks out of the ring to win them, and keep shooting while you hit." = "像弹弓一样拉回萨卡再松手。把羊拐骨击出圈外就归你，击中就能继续投。";
"%d m" = "%d 米";
"A draw" = "平局";
"Altybakan" = "六腿秋千";
"Baige" = "赛马";
"Bells: %d" = "铃铛：%d";
"Bring the serke first!" = "先带上山羊！";
"Close call!" = "险过！";
"Computer is thinking…" = "电脑思考中…";
"Distance: %d m" = "距离：%d 米";
"Dropped it!" = "掉了！";
"Gallop, jump, collect, win the race" = "奔跑、跳跃、收集，赢得赛马";
"Goal %d! +%d" = "第 %d 球！+%d";
"Goals: %d" = "进球：%d";
"Got the serke! +50" = "抓到山羊！+50";
"Kokpar" = "叼羊";
"Next bell: %d°" = "下一个铃铛：%d°";
"Out: %d / %d" = "击出：%d / %d";
"Pit %d: %d" = "第 %d 格：%d";
"Ride, dodge rivals, deliver the serke" = "策马躲开对手，把山羊送到目的地";
"Serke" = "山羊";
"Speed up!" = "加速！";
"Swing higher and ring the bells" = "荡得更高，敲响铃铛";
"Swipe from your saqa toward the asyks. Knock them all out of the ring before you run out of throws. Several in one throw earn a bonus." = "从萨卡向羊拐骨的方向滑动。在投掷次数用完前把它们全部击出圈外。一次击出多个有奖励。";
"Swipe left or right to change lanes. Grab the serke, dodge the rival riders and carry it to the kazan." = "左右滑动切换赛道。抓起山羊，躲开对手，送进大锅。";
"Swipe to start" = "滑动开始";
"Tap again to play this pit" = "再点一次即可走这一格";
"Tap as the swing passes the glowing spot to pump it higher. Reach the bells on both sides. Three mistimed taps end the ride." = "秋千经过发光处时点击，荡得更高。碰响两侧的铃铛。三次点错时机游戏结束。";
"Tap to jump, hold to jump higher. Clear fences, rocks and ditches, collect coins and grab the golden whip for a burst of speed." = "点击跳跃，按住跳得更高。越过围栏、岩石和沟渠，收集金币，拾取金鞭加速冲刺。";
"The Kazakh strategy game of nine pebbles" = "哈萨克族九子策略棋";
"The computer captured %d" = "电脑吃掉了 %d 颗";
"The computer made a tuzdyk" = "电脑做出了“图兹迪克”";
"The computer won" = "电脑获胜";
"This move captures %d" = "这一步能吃 %d 颗";
"This move makes a tuzdyk!" = "这一步会形成“图兹迪克”！";
"Throws: %d" = "投掷：%d";
"Togyzkumalak" = "托古兹库马拉克";
"Too early or late!" = "太早或太晚！";
"Try the highlighted pit" = "试试高亮的那一格";
"Tuzdyk! This pit is yours now" = "图兹迪克！这一格归你了";
"You captured %d" = "你吃掉了 %d 颗";
"You won!" = "你赢了！";
"Your move" = "轮到你";
"Quick" = "快速";
"Your kazan" = "你的锅";
"Computer's kazan" = "电脑的锅";
"Pick a pit to see what it does, then tap it again to play. Collect 31 pebbles to win." = "选一格先预览效果，再点一次即可落子。收集 31 颗石子获胜。";
"Sow counter-clockwise. End on the opponent's side with an even count to capture it; make exactly 3 to claim a tuzdyk. Collect 82 to win." = "逆时针撒子。在对方一侧以偶数结束就能吃掉该格；恰好 3 颗则形成“图兹迪克”。收集 82 颗获胜。";
"Asyk atu is a traditional Kazakh game. Knock the asyks out of the ring with your saqa. Each level has a different arrangement and a limited number of throws. Clear the ring to move on." = "阿斯克是哈萨克族传统游戏。用萨卡把羊拐骨击出圈外。每一关布局不同，投掷次数有限。清空圈内即可过关。";
"Put your finger on the saqa and swipe toward the asyks, farther for a harder throw. Before throwing, drag along the bottom line to move the saqa." = "手指按在萨卡上，朝羊拐骨方向滑动，滑得越远力度越大。投之前可沿底线拖动调整位置。";
"Pick a pit and sow its pebbles counter-clockwise, one per pit. If the last pebble lands on the opponent's side and makes the pit even, you capture it. Exactly 3 makes a tuzdyk, a pit that feeds your kazan from then on (not the 9th pit). Reach more than half the pebbles to win." = "选一格，逆时针每格放一颗。如果最后一颗落在对方一侧并使该格变成偶数，就吃掉它。恰好 3 颗则形成“图兹迪克”，此后该格会持续为你的锅加子（第 9 格除外）。拿到过半石子即获胜。";
"Tap one of your pits (the bottom row). In Quick mode, tap once to preview the move and again to play it. Use Hint for the computer's best suggestion." = "点击你自己的一格（下排）。快速模式下，第一次点击预览，第二次点击落子。提示会给出电脑认为最好的一步。";
"Pump the swing higher and ring the golden bells hung along both sides of the arc. Each bell is higher than the last. Three mistimed taps end the ride, and the swing slows down if you stop pumping." = "把秋千荡得更高，敲响弧线两侧的金色铃铛。每个铃铛都比上一个更高。三次时机错误游戏结束，停止发力秋千会慢慢停下。";
"Tap just as the swing passes the glowing spot at the bottom. The brighter centre gives the biggest push." = "秋千经过底部发光处的瞬间点击。更亮的中心给的力最大。";
"Grab the serke lying on the field, dodge the rival riders and carry it into the kazan at the end. A hit costs a life and makes you drop the serke. Every goal makes the next field longer and harder." = "抓起场上的山羊，躲开对手，把它送进终点的大锅。被撞到会失去一条命并掉落山羊。每进一球，下一场就更长更难。";
"Swipe left or right to change lanes. You can also tap the left or right side of the field." = "左右滑动切换赛道，也可以点击场地的左侧或右侧。";
"Gallop as far as you can. Jump over fences, rocks and ditches, collect coins and grab the golden whip for a burst of speed. A hit costs a life, and three lives are all you get." = "尽可能跑得更远。越过围栏、岩石和沟渠，收集金币，拾取金鞭加速。被撞到会失去一条命，一共只有三条。";
"Tap to jump. Hold your finger down for a higher jump, and tap just before landing to jump again at once." = "点击跳跃。按住手指跳得更高；落地前一刻点击可立即再跳。";
